# ── Large generated artifacts — reproduce via tools/ ─────────────────────────
# Globs, not exact names: weights/ weights_3b/ onnx/ onnx_3b/ reference/ ...
# A bare `weights/` left weights_3b (6.8 GB) untracked-but-not-ignored, one
# `git add -A` away from being in the history forever.
weights*/
onnx*/
reference*/
engine*/

*.trt
*.onnx
*.onnx_data
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.pt
*.pth

# Benchmark prompt corpora (regenerate or supply your own)
prompts.txt
prompts200.txt

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/

# ── C++ / CUDA build ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
*.o
*.so
*.ncu-rep
compile_commands.json

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ── Logs and scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
nohup.out

# NOTE: benchmarks/*.json IS tracked on purpose — those are results, and
# `bench_vs_vllm.py --compare` reads them.
